        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add autocompleted flag to tool call analytics",
        "summary": "Added `autocompleted` boolean to analytics payloads in `processStreamWithTags`. Tracks when stream completion triggers automatic parameter filling. Scope: `backend/src/xml-stream-parser.ts`. Default false; set true only if `completionSuffix` is appended to buffer.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T12:03:07.268Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The analytics system now records whether a tool call was completed by the assistant automatically filling in parameter values versus being explicitly provided by the user. This affects internal monitoring and logging, not your interaction with the product. If you look at the backend logs, you'll see a new true/false indicator next to each tool call's analytics entry, set to true only when the stream completion appends extra content automatically.",
